  "description": "Apache Avro serialization plugin for the Excalibur framework. Schema-based binary serialization optimized for streaming and Kafka scenarios. Requires matching reader and writer schemas (no writer-schema resolution); writer/reader schema skew is detected via the Avro single-object-encoding fingerprint and fails closed (throws), never silently mis-decoded. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
